  "question": {
    "text": "A block is dragged on a smooth horizontal plane with the help of a light rope which moves with a velocity <math><mi>v</mi></math> as shown in figure. The horizontal velocity of the block is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image8-0fd6ba52-cfaf-4c1e-a0cd-a3940b8e0731.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 216px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FeBgj",
      "text": "<math><mi>v</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "wR8nL",
      "text": "<math><mi>v</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GCPVm",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "qH0J6",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi> </mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From geometry <math><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> but <math><mi>y</mi></math> is constant, hence differentiating, we have, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />But <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi></math>. Hence horizontal velocity of block,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image36-d90b5aa1-d6ae-4583-b7f3-cc8c67c7feb3.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 152px;\" /><br /><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></math> or <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math>",
    "image": null
  },
